      "text": [
        ": قُلْتُ لَهُ الْجَارِيَةُ الشَّابَّةُ الَّتِي لَا تَحِيضُ وَ مِثْلُهَا تَحِيضُ طَلَّقَهَا زَوْجُهَا قَالَ عِدَّتُهَا ثَلَاثَةُ أَشْهُرٍ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4796 - Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Nasr Al-Bazanti narrated from Abdul Karim ibn Amr, from Muhammad ibn Hakim, from the Righteous Servant (Imam Musa ibn Jafar Al-Kadhim (as)).\nHe said: I asked him about a young girl who does not menstruate, though others like her do menstruate, and her husband divorces her.\nImam (as) said: \"Her waiting period is three months.\""
        ]
      }
